| RISC3D test: the spinning cube with zero-copy frames (kit 12).
| Needs rol-fb's overlays (RISC OS on Linux's PlaneTest build) and a
| 16 million colour mode; otherwise it reads frames back, as Cube does,
| and its title bar says why.
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.01 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.RISC3D
RMEnsure Linux3D 0.01 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.Linux3D
Run <Obey$Dir>.r3dcube -overlay
